{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-western-philosophy","title":"西方哲学之父","url":"/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-father-of-western-philosophy","wordCount":1822,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/c/people/socrates/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1591,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章对苏格拉底作出综合评价。\"西方哲学之父\"，是对苏格拉底崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他奠定了哲学的方向、开创了哲学的方法、成为哲学谱系的源头。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越贡献与崇高人格，又客观正视围绕他的种种探讨，以辩证的眼光，认识这位永恒的哲人典范。\n"}